* Auto-generated testbench for regulator feedback: U301
* Divider: R301/R302, ratio=0.1605
* Expected Vout=5.0V, Vfb=0.8026V (Vref=0.6V)
* Topology: standard
* Model: ideal passives (exact for DC divider)

VIN out_rail 0 DC 5.0
R301 out_rail fb_net 52.3k
R302 fb_net 0 10k

.control
op 
let vfb_sim = v(fb_net)
let expected = 0.80257
let error_pct = abs(vfb_sim - expected) / expected * 100
echo "vfb_sim=$&vfb_sim error_pct=$&error_pct expected=0.80257 vin=5.0 vref=0.6" > E:/Projects/duck-robot/docs/references/hat-simulation-tools-20261029/ttl-bypass-20261031/spice-work/regulator-feedback_U301_R301_R302.out
quit
.endc

